      "source": [
        "# Directional Command Recognition in Sinhala-English Speech Using Whisper ASR + LaBSE Semantic Similarity\n",
        "\n",
        "A robust pipeline for recognizing directional commands (forward, backward, left, right, stop) in code-mixed Sinhala-English speech using state-of-the-art ASR and Language-Agnostic BERT Sentence Embeddings (LaBSE).\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "e896c478",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "e896c478"
      },
