        "### Project Overview"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "visual_pipeline_cell",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "visual_pipeline_cell"
      },
      "source": [
        "### \ud83d\udee0 System Architecture & Model Pipeline\n",
        "\n",
        "#### 1. Pipeline Visualization\n",
        "Below is a descriptive overview of the end-to-end pipeline for directional command recognition from raw audio:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Audio Processing:**\n",
        "   - The system begins with raw audio input, which undergoes preprocessing steps such as silence trimming, DC offset removal, and RMS normalization to ensure consistent quality.\n",
        "2. **Feature Extraction:**\n",
        "   - The preprocessed audio is transcribed into text using the fine-tuned Whisper-Small ASR engine.\n",
        "   - The resulting text is then passed through the **LaBSE** model, which generates a dense **768-dimensional** semantic embedding that captures the multilingual intent of the command.\n",
        "3. **Classification:**\n",
        "   - The semantic embedding is fed into a PyTorch classifier featuring **Residual Blocks** and **Batch Normalization**. This neural network processes the embedding through multiple layers with **GELU** activation and dropout to predict the directional command (Forward, Backward, Left, Right, or Stop).\n",
        "\n",
        "This pipeline ensures that the system can robustly handle noisy, code-mixed speech and accurately map spoken commands to actionable directions for downstream applications.\n",
        "\n",
        "#### 2. Core Model Concepts (Layer Format)\n",
        "\n",
        "| **Component** | **Model/Layer Type** | **Key Function** |\n",
        "| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n",
        "| **ASR Engine** | **Whisper-Small** | Fine-tuned for Sinhala-English code-mixed speech to provide robust transcription across accents. |\n",
        "| **Embedding** | **LaBSE** | Transforms transcribed text into a 768-dimensional semantic vector, capturing the intent and meaning of the command in a language-agnostic space. |\n",
        "| **Classifier** | **Input/BatchNorm** | Scales and standardizes the 768-D semantic vector for stable training. |\n",
        "| **Classifier** | **Residual Blocks** | Employs skip-connections to facilitate deeper feature learning without gradient degradation. |\n",
        "| **Classifier** | **GELU Activation** | Provides advanced non-linear modeling for complex linguistic patterns. |\n",
        "| **Classifier** | **Dropout** | Prevents overfitting by randomly masking features during training, improving model generalization. |\n",
        "| **Classifier** | **Output Layer** | Maps the learned features to one of the five directional command classes. |\n"
      ]
    },
